      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.02,
      "end_seconds": 212.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.15,
      "end_seconds": 217.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.69,
      "end_seconds": 221.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.32,
      "end_seconds": 240.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Reflexes are a bit slow to relax."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.57,
      "end_seconds": 248.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "good, you can sit up again"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.23,
      "end_seconds": 271.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.31,
      "end_seconds": 276.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.96,
      "end_seconds": 295.94,
      "duration_seconds": 17.98,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now an underactive thyroid is my leading thought, not anything worse. So, to recap quickly. You've been feeling cold all the time for about three months, and no hair loss or low mood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.21,
      "end_seconds": 298.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.77,
      "end_seconds": 318.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "we should do a thyroid test for hypothyroid symptoms let's book blood tests to look into fatigue"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.39,
      "end_seconds": 325.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Where would I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.46,
      "end_seconds": 362.2,
      "duration_seconds": 35.74,
      "text": "For this, levothyroxine, 50 micrograms, every morning on an empty stomach, until we review. You take it by mouth. That should help with hypothyroidism. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. Take the thyroid tablet on an empty stomach, half an hour before breakfast, and not with calcium or iron. Come back after the results are back. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.8,
      "end_seconds": 376.11,
      "duration_seconds": 12.31,
      "text": "So, I take the levothyroxine, 50 micrograms, every morning on an empty stomach and come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 377.5,
      "end_seconds": 383.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
